    "input_texts": [
      "The agent is constructing a filter for the Change Requests list to find specific entries. This step involves setting the value for the first condition field, 'Type', to 'Normal', which is part of a multi-step process to define AND conditions for filtering.\n\nIn the pre-state, the 'Type' combobox (a1639) is expanded and focused, showing available options, but no value is selected yet. After the action, the combobox's value updates to 'normal', indicating that the 'Normal' option has been successfully selected for the 'Type' field in the filter condition.",
      "Continuing the filter construction, the agent finalizes the first condition by confirming the 'Type is Normal' rule. This action prepares the interface to define the second condition in the series of AND filters required to meet the goal.\n\nIn the pre-state, the filter condition for 'Type' is set to 'Normal' but not yet confirmed in the condition list. After clicking the 'Add AND Condition To Condition 1' button, a new condition entry appears in the filter toolbar labeled 'Type is Normal'. The system then focuses the field chooser combobox (a1659) for the next condition, allowing the agent to select the 'Requested by' field for the subsequent filter criteria."
