    "input_texts": [
      "Title: ServiceNow Change Request List: Building AND Filters\nDescription: Step-by-step workflow for adding multiple AND filter conditions to the Change Request list.\n- Open the filter panel by clicking the 'Show / hide filter' button (bid a47) to reveal filter inputs.\n- Click the field chooser combobox for the first condition (e.g., 'All of these conditions must be met. -- choose field --') to select a field.\n- Select the desired field (e.g., 'Type', 'Requested by') from the dropdown list.\n- For fields with fixed values, click the value chooser combobox (e.g., 'Choose option for field: Type') and select the specific option (e.g., 'Normal').\n- For fields requiring text input, click the corresponding textbox (e.g., 'Requested by') and fill in the required value.\n- Click the 'Add AND Condition To Condition X' button (e.g., 'Add AND Condition To Condition 1: Type is Normal') to append the next filter.\n- Repeat the field selection, operator setting, and value entry steps for each subsequent AND condition.\n- Note: The trajectory ended after adding the 'Short description' condition step; the 'State' condition was not yet added."
